Which version of rpy have you got?  Which version of R?

> Unable to determine R version from the registry. Trying another method.

Have you got the Mark Hammond's win32api module installed?  This is used 
to read the Windows registry - the link is on the rpy downloads page.

The second question is when you installed R, did it update the registry? 
  This is an option at install time (defaults to true I think).

As Toby suggested, alternatively you can create an environment variable 
R_HOME instead (however I think his instructions are for Linux!).

